    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Two Rivers National Wildlife Refuge nearby spans 9,000 acres of bottomland hardwoods, prairies, and wetlands along the Illinois and Mississippi Rivers.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
