      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Early settlers like the Crader family supplied cordwood to steamboats such as the Argus in the 1830s, fueling river trade.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3,
        27
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
